@startuml State_Reservation
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty description

title SALESTORM – Inventory Unit / Reservation State Diagram

[*] --> AVAILABLE : unit loaded into sale\n(available_quantity++)

AVAILABLE --> RESERVED : Buy Now succeeds\n[Redis gate OK AND DB conditional UPDATE = 1 row]\n/ available--, reserved++, expires_at = now+10m

RESERVED --> PAYMENT_PENDING : checkout started\n[not expired] / order created

PAYMENT_PENDING --> CONFIRMED : payment.succeeded event\n(idempotent by event_id)

CONFIRMED --> SOLD : stock committed\n/ reserved--, sold++

SOLD --> [*]

RESERVED --> TIMEOUT : now > expires_at\n(ExpiryJob / Redis TTL)
PAYMENT_PENDING --> TIMEOUT : now > expires_at AND\npayment not SUCCEEDED / unknown\n(reconciler checks gateway first)
PAYMENT_PENDING --> PAYMENT_FAILED : payment.failed event
RESERVED --> RELEASED : customer cancels

PAYMENT_FAILED --> RELEASED : / reserved--, available++,\nRedis INCR stock, SREM buyer
TIMEOUT --> RELEASED : / reserved--, available++,\nRedis INCR stock, SREM buyer

RELEASED --> AVAILABLE : unit back in pool\n(next buyer in waiting room can reserve)

note right of AVAILABLE
  **Invariant (DB CHECK):**
  available + reserved + sold = total
  available >= 0, reserved >= 0, sold >= 0
  => successful reservations can never exceed stock
end note

note bottom of RELEASED
  Every transition = one local ACID transaction
  + AUDIT_LOG row + outbox event.
  Transitions are guarded: UPDATE ... WHERE status = '<expected>'
  => concurrent/duplicate events cannot double-release.
end note
@enduml
